{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>無綫年度盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶》紅地毯向來是女星爭妍鬥麗戰場，今年戴祖儀憑藉兩套風格迥異戰衣再度成為全場焦點。她在錄影廠內換上深V內搭與周嘉洛及吳偉豪熱烈交談，卻意外引發一段惹人注目的台下插曲。男方一個不經意微傾身體與側目舉動，瞬間讓這幕畫面成為網絡瘋傳焦點。</p>\n<h2>今年戰衣細節滿分 透視跌膊兼大露背</h2>\n<p>從今年曝光的台慶造型可見，戴祖儀繼續沿用最能襯托白皙肌膚的銀色系晚裝，但設計上花足心思。她捨棄了去年的無肩帶款式，改以「跌膊一字肩」設計示人，並配搭閃鑽頸鏈及一頭黑長直髮，散發高貴女神氣場。戰衣最大亮點在於胸前採用薄紗透視剪裁，綴以精緻銀色閃石刺繡，令事業線在若隱若現間更添誘惑；轉身更暗藏玄機，大露背透視設計將其白滑美背與纖腰表露無遺，加上裙襬右腿高開衩剪裁，一雙修長美腿依然搶鏡。當晚她更與陳曉華及吳偉豪同框合照，三人站在一起相當養眼；而進入錄影廠後，她亦換上墨綠色西裝外套配搭白色內襯，與吳偉豪及周嘉洛有講有笑，在性感與型格之間切換自如。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549464312963414_7509269376b0512f39356e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"joeythyee_1795258442_4035241610417342019_354558212.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549464312963414_7509269376b0512f39356e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>展現透視仙氣性感（圖片來源：IG@joeythyee）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17954946474122755_8314627616b0512f80ae44.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"joeythyee_1795258442_4035241617539282343_354558212.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17954946474122755_8314627616b0512f80ae44.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@joeythyee）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>戴祖儀上屆台慶戰鬥格成經典</h2>\n<p>回顧上一屆台慶夜，戴祖儀以一身極具侵略性戰鬥格大晒冷，當時她身穿銀色閃片抹胸晚裝，超低胸心形剪裁令豐滿上圍一覽無遺。裙襬更採用大膽超高開衩設計，遊走於走光邊緣，當時與她一同出場郭柏妍亦坦言「怕凍」間接認輸。兩屆造型對比之下，她由去年極限火辣進化成今年高級神秘感，連續兩年穿著銀色閃片元素長裙亮相台慶。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549465128684716_9844589326b0512fb94565.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"joeythyee_1763652332_3770111478641918285_354558212.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549465128684716_9844589326b0512fb94565.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>上屆台慶戰鬥格成經典（圖片來源：IG@joeythyee）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>網民熱議台慶夜紅地毯大贏家</h2>\n<p>戴祖儀連續兩年精心挑選戰衣赴會並成功突圍，不少網民對於她今年兩套服裝切換給予高度評價。有人留言表示「今年套裙好有仙氣」、「換咗西裝入面件衫好惹火」，甚至有網民留意到台下吳偉豪舉動，笑指「連吳偉豪都忍唔住𥄫實」。網上輿論普遍認為她今年表現亮眼，穩坐大眾心中紅地毯大贏家位置，相關截圖及討論熱門程度持續高企。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549465362139558_9187454676b0512fe1b4e7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"joeythyee_1795258442_4035241605468062538_354558212.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549465362139558_9187454676b0512fe1b4e7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>今年造型都冇得輸！（圖片來源：IG@joeythyee）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549465920783878_16234603096b051303af979.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"joeythyee_1795258442_4035241623092556073_354558212.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549465920783878_16234603096b051303af979.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@joeythyee）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549466215699428_16260170786b0513068fa0e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"joeythyee_1795258442_4035241619762202723_354558212.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549466215699428_16260170786b0513068fa0e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@joeythyee）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549466549077848_11871728196b051309ca4aa.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"joeythyee_1795258442_4035241625273602899_354558212.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549466549077848_11871728196b051309ca4aa.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@joeythyee）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549466874579214_18337045086b05130d26cb1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"joeythyee_1763652332_3770111478910390366_354558212.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549466874579214_18337045086b05130d26cb1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>上年MVP（圖片來源：IG@joeythyee）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549465128684716_9844589326b0512fb94565.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"joeythyee_1763652332_3770111478641918285_354558212.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179549465128684716_9844589326b0512fb94565.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@joeythyee）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T04:43:55.566279+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1178,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T04:31:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T06:17:21.572484+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T04:37:26.294280+00:00","content_hash":"fe6b98fb1fddefdcd3c2ac8ab1d80542c2be429aa9d1ade339b2a6c0acfd2884","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}